OL,3,GNEWSACash security staff to strike over
OL,4,A1% pay rise
OL,5,
OL,6,FWorkers at a large security company are
OL,7,Fset to strike over a pay dispute.
OL,9,FDozens of workers at G4S's cash depot
OL,10,Fin Harlow, Essex, have voted to take
OL,11,Faction in the run up to Christmas after
OL,12,Fsaying they were offered a pay rise of
OL,13,F1%, with no sign of an improved offer.
OL,15,FThe union represents 90% of personnel
OL,16,Fat the site, who provide security for
OL,17,Fthe transfer of cash and valuables
OL,18,Fbetween banks and businesses.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,376,370,200,160,0,100
