OL,3,GNEWSACash security staff to strike over
OL,4,A1% pay rise
OL,5,
OL,6,FG4S said it had not received formal
OL,7,Fnotification of the strikes but it
OL,8,Fwould be "open to engaging" with the
OL,9,FGMB and hoped to "reach an amicable
OL,10,Fagreement without the need for
OL,11,Findustrial action".
